  "bodyHash": "P9M2zkNTJog=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组为Macaw的模组与“你将去的生物群系”增加了兼容性，你是否一直梦想建造一座白杨木桥……现在，有了这个模组，一切皆有可能！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>我之前安装了Macaw的桥梁/栅栏/屋顶/家具 - BYG版本，听说安装这个模组会删除所有已放置的桥梁？</em></p><p>请放心，</p><p>Forge版本会自动转换旧版兼容性中的所有方块与物品。</p><p>Fabric版本则暂时依赖另一个模组，你需要配合预填配置文件使用，该文件会在游戏启动时自动生成（类似配置文件机制）——更多信息请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>本模组支持以下内容 :&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>- Macaw的桥梁</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/548/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的屋顶</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/549/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的栅栏</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/551/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的家具</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/550/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的楼梯</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/553/2025-01-26_14.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>1.1 更新内容 :</em></span></strong></p><p>- Macaw的小径</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/885/2025-02-15_18-01-08-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的门</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/887/2025-02-15_18-08-48-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的活板门</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/886/2025-02-15_18-02-24-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>- Macaw的窗户</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/888/2025-02-15_18-05-02-png.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>必须依赖项:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">你将去的生物群系（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE版</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC版</a>）以及1.20.1+版本的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">我们已去的生物群系</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Terrablender（1.18.2+版本，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE版</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC版</a>）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/updatefixerupper\" rel=\"nofollow\">UpdateFixerUpper</a>（Fabric 1.18.2-1.19.2版本）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-data-fixers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Data Fixers</a>（Fabric 1.19.3-1.20.1版本）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>可选依赖项:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw的模组系列</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
